Package: maplandata
Type: Package
Title: Download and Load CMS Medicare Advantage Plan Enrollment Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to automatically pull Medicare Advantage / Part D contract
    and enrollment data files published by CMS (cms.gov), detect when a
    source file on cms.gov has changed so re-runs only re-download what is
    new, and load the most up-to-date local copy of any dataset into R
    regardless of whether the underlying file is .csv, .xls, or .xlsx.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 3.6)
